## Working agreements

- Prefer `just` targets when available (`just check`, `just format`, `just dev`).
- Keep changes aligned with the layered Python architecture enforced by `import-linter`.
- For frontend changes, keep reusable pieces in `admin-ui/src/shared/**` and route screens in `admin-ui/src/pages/**`.

## Before finishing a change

- Backend: run `python -m ruff format .` and `python -m ruff check .`
- Frontend: run `npm run format` and `npm run lint`

